WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.240
How long does the setup take?

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:03.320
It really depends how complicated your setup is.

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:04.840
Usually it is four weeks.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.960
Whether it's a website, full SEO, paid ads,
lead generation systems, or any AI automations,

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:10.920
from start to finish, it is four weeks.

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:14.660
So you can expect from A to Z
to be done in exactly four weeks.
